<!-- 公共动作要领与 GIF 动图半屏抽屉（z-index: 1200，可稳稳覆盖在选动作/替换抽屉之上） -->
<view wx:if="{{visible && exercise}}" class="ex-guide-overlay" bindtap="onClose" catchtouchmove="noop">
  <view class="ex-guide-sheet" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="ex-guide-handle"></view>

    <view class="ex-guide-header">
      <text class="ex-guide-title">{{exercise.name}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{exercise.name_en}}" class="ex-guide-subtitle">{{exercise.name_en}}</text>
    </view>

    <scroll-view scroll-y class="ex-guide-scroll" show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
      <view wx:if="{{exercise.gif_url && !gifLoadError}}" class="ex-guide-gif-wrap">
        <image
          class="ex-guide-gif"
          src="{{exercise.gif_url}}"
          mode="aspectFit"
          lazy-load="{{true}}"
          binderror="onGifError"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="ex-guide-tags">
        <text wx:if="{{exercise.muscle_group}}" class="ex-guide-tag">{{exercise.muscle_group}}{{exercise.sub_muscle ? ' · ' + exercise.sub_muscle : ''}}</text>
        <text wx:if="{{exercise.equipment}}" class="ex-guide-tag tag-equip">{{exercise.equipment}}</text>
        <text wx:if="{{exercise.is_system === false}}" class="ex-guide-tag">自定义动作</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{exercise.target_muscles}}" class="ex-guide-block">
        <text class="ex-guide-label">目标肌群</text>
        <text class="ex-guide-text">{{exercise.target_muscles}}</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{exercise.description}}" class="ex-guide-block">
        <text class="ex-guide-label">动作要领</text>
        <text class="ex-guide-text">{{exercise.description}}</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{exercise.tips}}" class="ex-guide-block ex-guide-tips">
        <text class="ex-guide-label">呼吸与避坑</text>
        <text class="ex-guide-text">{{exercise.tips}}</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{!exercise.description}}" class="ex-guide-block">
        <text class="ex-guide-text">自定义动作暂无要领说明，可在训练或编排计划时直接使用。</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{allowDelete && exercise.is_system === false}}" class="ex-guide-delete" bindtap="onDelete">
        <text>删除此自定义动作</text>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="ex-guide-footer">
      <view class="ex-guide-close-btn" bindtap="onClose">知道了</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
